Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.50,0:02:13.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE (OVER SNAIL)]\NThis is the main gate with\Nanother urgent report, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.93,0:02:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NWhat is it this time?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.74,0:02:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NThere's a group of heavily armed men\Nriding giant monsters over the gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.63,0:02:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NWe need reinforcements!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.51,0:02:32.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.49,0:02:34.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't waste a second!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.56,0:02:36.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NLet's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.56,0:02:42.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.80,0:02:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.00,0:02:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.98,0:02:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NHaving second thoughts now?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.69,0:03:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUCCI]\NIt's too late for that.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.48,0:03:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NAll right guys, you ready to roll?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.55,0:03:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you hurt?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.72,0:03:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NDon't worry, these wounds\Nmatter not...to Sniper King!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.66,0:03:43.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NOnly four minutes left!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.10,0:03:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then the sea train, Rocketman,\Nis gonna tear through!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.79,0:04:01.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you but\Ncould you let me pass?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.55,0:04:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NEven if you ask nicely.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.70,0:04:07.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still an intruder.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.36,0:04:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And no means no!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.91,0:04:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.00,0:04:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'll warn you.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.37,0:04:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.34,0:04:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NBring it on, pirate!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.26,0:04:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum...Ally Robot!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.73,0:04:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NHey, that's cheating!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NHow can we attack him?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.34,0:04:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NIt's just a lame childish trick!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.41,0:04:42.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't back down!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.71,0:04:45.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAlly Robot...Punch!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.62,0:04:47.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.41,0:04:48.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.00,0:04:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAlly Robot Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.54,0:04:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NI didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.34,0:04:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.67,0:05:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NI've had enough of your games!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NYour back is wide open!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.79,0:05:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NBastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.06,0:05:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NBring him down!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.23,0:05:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's only one of him!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.28,0:05:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NDamn it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.15,0:05:53.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NHow does he do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.12,0:05:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you'll have more\Npeople to fight later!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.35,0:05:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.57,0:06:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.44,0:06:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.84,0:06:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NHe went inside!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.71,0:06:10.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.41,0:06:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NHe made it to the main island!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.67,0:06:14.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.37,0:06:15.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.81,0:06:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS (OVER SNAIL)]\NThis is the front gate, reporting!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.08,0:06:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Straw Hat Luffy has\Nentered the main island, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.02,0:06:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.85,0:06:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you let him do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.03,0:06:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.86,0:06:27.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about Oimo and Kashii?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.00,0:06:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me\Nthey got taken out, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.97,0:06:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS (OVER SNAIL)]\NWell, it's actually the middle\Nof the night right now, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking they're probably asleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.14,0:06:38.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then stop yapping at\Nme and wake them up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.95,0:06:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if any of the other guards\Nare sleeping, wake them up, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.85,0:06:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS (OVER SNAIL)]\NYes, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.00,0:06:47.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[JABURA]\NI don't get why everyone's\Npissing their pants over this.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.78,0:06:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's one little intruder?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.87,0:06:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just let us take care of 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NNonsense!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.14,0:06:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This place is the entrance\Nto the World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.62,0:07:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Judicial Island isn't just a Navy\Nbase, it's a symbol of justice!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.59,0:07:04.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NAny idiot should know what\Nit means to attack Enies Lobby
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.83,0:07:07.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and if they don't,\Nwe'll have to teach them!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we let some dirty band\Nof pirates waltz in here
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.54,0:07:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and take their crewmember back,\Nwhat does that say about our forces?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.01,0:07:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to beat them!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.44,0:07:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our pride is on the line!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.11,0:07:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those Straw Hats are going\Nto learn not to take us lightly.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.46,0:07:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.16,0:07:22.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gatekeeper!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.86,0:07:25.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on at the main gate?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.34,0:07:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, or what?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.58,0:07:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many enemies are\Nwe looking at here?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.98,0:07:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are they right now?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.71,0:07:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]\NI need answers, Main Gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.94,0:07:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.08,0:07:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.88,0:07:37.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.11,0:07:39.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help you if\Nyou don't help me first!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.18,0:07:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't call me and\Nthen hang up, did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.32,0:07:42.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.89,0:07:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NRope Action!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.17,0:07:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Figure Eight Knot!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.40,0:07:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bazooka Bat Strike!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.10,0:07:52.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh heh!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.97,0:07:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're just starting!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.98,0:07:55.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't go wasting my ammo!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.78,0:07:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go in through the doors on the side!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.32,0:07:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open that gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.89,0:08:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NPush 'em back, before it's too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.17,0:08:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI & MOZU]\NYou're in the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.90,0:08:08.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI]\NMozu, take the left!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.44,0:08:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOZU]\NYou got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.11,0:08:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NYou're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.71,0:08:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a nose hair?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's a cowlick!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.02,0:08:22.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.18,0:08:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI]\NThanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe you one!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.76,0:08:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TILESTONE]\NMy Keel Breaker!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.47,0:08:41.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NAre you done?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.34,0:08:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mozu?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.84,0:08:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiwi?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.44,0:08:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI]\NWe tear ships apart.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.91,0:08:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't expect a\Nlittle lock to slow us down!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.17,0:08:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.87,0:08:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My side is done!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.14,0:08:53.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOZU]\NMine too!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.18,0:08:54.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NLet's open those gates!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.18,0:08:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herculean Destroyers go!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.69,0:09:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NDon't let them open the gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.16,0:09:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NShut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.13,0:09:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NAll right men, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.28,0:09:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MEN]\NWhoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.82,0:09:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\N{\an8}We made it through the main gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.09,0:09:41.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that big hole?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.23,0:09:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWe don't have time for that right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just ignore it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.27,0:09:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NEveryone make a dash for the next gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.56,0:09:50.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NIt's a waterfall!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.06,0:09:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI & MOZU]\NWe did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NGuys over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.07,0:09:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.37,0:10:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you lend me a hand?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.67,0:10:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GATEKEEPERS]\NKashii!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.27,0:10:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to get up!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.21,0:10:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need your help!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.86,0:10:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The main gate was\Nforced open by intruders!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.85,0:10:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CASHY]\NHey Oimo, you hear that?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.16,0:10:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said the main gate's open.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.77,0:10:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.41,0:10:27.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OIMO]\NI'm afraid that won't do.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.44,0:10:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Kashii?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.51,0:10:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I was sleeping so well, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.25,0:10:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CASHY]\NWork is work.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.15,0:10:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OIMO & CASHY]\NUp and at 'em!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CASHY]\N{\an8}These pipsqueaks don't look like much.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.14,0:11:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}C'mon.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.04,0:11:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You wanna get back to bed soon, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.14,0:11:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's make this quick.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.92,0:11:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OIMO]\N{\an8}Sounds good.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.12,0:11:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWhoa, they, they're giants!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, twerps.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.05,0:11:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno what you think you're\Ndoing here and I don't really care.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.53,0:11:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Point is, you're getting\Ncrushed if you get in our way.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.43,0:11:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Oimo?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.72,0:11:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oi.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.62,0:11:19.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.32,0:11:21.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You tell 'em, Kashii.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.29,0:11:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One more step and we'll\Npound your bones into paste.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.54,0:11:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NDude, this isn't fair!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.71,0:11:29.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me these guys\Nhad giants for gatekeepers!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.18,0:11:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NThey're huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.26,0:11:34.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They make our Herculean\NDestroyers look like runts!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.55,0:11:35.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, go home!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.42,0:11:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm letting you through!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.22,0:11:40.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me neither!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.25,0:11:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NHere they come!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.45,0:11:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NThe Franky Family ain't gonna\Nback down no matter what!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.03,0:11:45.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, you guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.80,0:11:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NDo it for Bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.51,0:11:55.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, you know what that means.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.45,0:11:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.99,0:11:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.71,0:12:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those giants may be a lot bigger\Nthan us but we're still pretty big!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.61,0:12:08.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWe've torn apart ships\Nten times their size!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.35,0:12:10.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These freaks are nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.72,0:12:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NGo Destroyers!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.21,0:12:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NNo!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.94,0:12:38.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our Herculean Destroyers!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.64,0:12:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NThey... They got pounded!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.48,0:12:45.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have the blood of warriors\Nrunning through our veins!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.92,0:12:47.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An overgrown human is still a human,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.42,0:12:51.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but a giant of any size\Nis a fighter at heart!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.56,0:12:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CASHY]\NBy the pride of my people,\NI won't let you pass!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.36,0:12:56.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.06,0:12:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OIMO]\NMe too!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.78,0:12:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NDon't uh... Don't get\Ncold feet, everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.41,0:13:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can still do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.45,0:13:05.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NThat's right, our Big Bro is waiting\Nfor us on the other side of that gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.54,0:13:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWe'll show those monsters a\Nfight worthy of bro's name!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Franky Family?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.51,0:13:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NHey, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.48,0:13:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many friends did\Nyou bring with you, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.05,0:13:30.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE]\NWe've got 10,000 soldiers\Nhere at Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.86,0:13:33.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSorry, but it's just me.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.38,0:13:38.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNow get out of my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.89,0:13:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NOur bro Franky wouldn't give up at\Na time like this, and neither will we!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.66,0:13:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NDon't give in!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.93,0:14:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta clear the way for Rocketman!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.71,0:14:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NBust down those doors!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.81,0:14:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OIMO]\NForget about it...I won't even\Nlet an ant through this gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.99,0:14:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOZU]\NThe Destroyers!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.62,0:14:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.15,0:14:27.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastards.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.25,0:14:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Took out our strongest guys\Nbefore I even got here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.79,0:14:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.89,0:14:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CASHY]\NWhat is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.76,0:14:42.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NZambai!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.91,0:14:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiwi!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.60,0:14:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mozu!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.30,0:14:46.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NGalley-La!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.55,0:14:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NSorry we're late!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.65,0:14:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Took a little longer than I thought\Nto get Sodom and Gomorrah ready for land!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.83,0:14:56.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NZambai!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.90,0:14:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They beat the Destroyers!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.50,0:15:01.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.57,0:15:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we don't have time\Nto patch them up right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.01,0:15:06.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters\Nis getting through that gate.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.78,0:15:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We came here to rescue our big bro\Nand that's just what we're gonna do!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.93,0:15:12.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's rock.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.66,0:15:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll send those\Nbig lugs crashing down!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.80,0:15:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI]\NCome on!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.73,0:15:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MOZU]\NYou got it, Kiwi!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.68,0:15:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.81,0:15:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI & MOZU]\NHull Dismantler.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.91,0:15:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slash!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.61,0:15:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NRope Action.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.68,0:15:38.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Timber Hitch Tug!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kashii no!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.80,0:16:00.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LULU]\NTilestone!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.73,0:16:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LULU]\NTreenail Lock!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.43,0:16:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TILESTONE]\NIt's a job well done!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.74,0:16:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OIMO]\NLittle runts!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.70,0:16:33.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.14,0:16:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kashii!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.28,0:16:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.58,0:16:57.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let up, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.52,0:17:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got one more to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.22,0:17:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MEN]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NWhat's the current status?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.11,0:17:12.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL (OVER SNAIL)]\NSir.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.04,0:17:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, Kashii and Oimo should be dealing
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.21,0:17:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with the intruders at the\Nmain island gate right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.58,0:17:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't suspect they're\Nhaving any trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.58,0:17:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:19.85,0:17:21.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NBut what about Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.55,0:17:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are we at on that one?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.12,0:17:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL (OVER SNAIL)]\N"Where are we at?" Ah.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.25,0:17:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is just an estimate,\Nbut I'd say about four hundred?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NFour Hundred?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.79,0:17:33.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.19,0:17:35.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL (OVER SNAIL)]\NOur casualties, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.43,0:17:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]\NYou're not making any sense, man!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.27,0:17:47.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're telling me Straw Hat\Nhas defeated 400 of our guards?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.00,0:17:50.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NLooks like we lost about\Na hundred more just now.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that number's wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll correct it, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.81,0:17:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]\NYou'd better!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.91,0:17:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our guards are well-trained.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.85,0:17:58.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned if one man\Ncould take that many out!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.70,0:18:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we have casualties,\Nat least report them properly!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.93,0:18:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.70,0:18:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then allow me to report again.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.60,0:18:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd estimate our current\Ncasualties at five...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.69,0:18:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]\NFive men?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.99,0:18:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've only lost five of our guards?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NJeez!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.56,0:18:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How in the world could you\Nmake such an obvious mistake!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.94,0:18:27.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Five hundred.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.50,0:18:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems Straw Hat's no threat after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.94,0:18:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's just running around the\Nisland, making a lot of noise.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.24,0:18:35.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's no surprise.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.74,0:18:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even he's not stupid enough to take\Non that many guards on his own.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.41,0:18:42.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either way, it's only a matter\Nof time before he's captured.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.96,0:18:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NGood to see you all back.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.16,0:18:49.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief, Mr. Lucci's party has arrived.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.13,0:18:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NExcellent!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.53,0:18:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.97,0:18:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show them in already.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.73,0:18:57.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NBy the way, Sniper King.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.78,0:19:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.30,0:19:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.50,0:19:06.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou think you could teach me how to use\Nthe cold air feature on this thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.27,0:19:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOGEKING]\NSure.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.97,0:19:08.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's simple...I mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.24,0:19:09.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking me?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.73,0:19:16.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NYou ready, ladies and gents?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The time has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.30,0:19:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NIf they don't have those gates\Nopen by now, it ain't gonna happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.74,0:19:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NHurry up and go! Hurry up and go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.58,0:19:25.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GONBE]\NMeow!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.78,0:19:30.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NI'm gonna need you to take out\Nthat iron fence, okay Samurai Man?
